  "title": "Preventing burnout",
  "summary": "Recognizing the signs of exhaustion and putting prevention strategies in place.",
  "sourceHash": "5cfe2ee30d7de695f06add6d295feb2a7f43e2ba42f7fcd93f97d9390695af43",
